$topic_title   = 'New Research Thread: Amycretin (GLP-1/Amylin Dual Agonist) — Phase 3 Initiated 2026';
$topic_content = '<p>Amycretin (NN9487) is Novo Nordisk\'s novel dual GLP-1 and amylin receptor agonist, now advancing into Phase 3 clinical development following impressive Phase 1b/2a data published in The Lancet (2025).</p>

<p><strong>Key highlights:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Phase 1b/2a (Lancet 2025): ~22% body weight reduction over 36 weeks at 20 mg subcutaneous weekly</li>
<li>Oral Phase 1 (Lancet 2025): 13.1% weight reduction in 12 weeks — with no plateau reached</li>
<li>Mechanism: GLP-1 receptor activation + amylin receptor activation (complementary satiety pathways)</li>
<li>Phase 3 initiation announced Q1 2026 for both SC and oral formulations</li>
</ul>

<p>Discussion questions:</p>
<ol>
<li>How does the dual GLP-1/amylin mechanism compare to the GLP-1/GIP approach of tirzepatide?</li>
